{
    "name": "Making Charcoal",
    "category": "tfg:craftsmanship",
    "icon": "minecraft:charcoal",
    "pages": [
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "anchor": "charcoal_pit",
            "text": "搭建$(thing)木炭坑$()是一種燒製$(thing)木炭$()的方法。木炭坑是用$(thing)原木堆$()構成的。手持$(thing)原木$()時按住$(item)$(k:key.sneak)$()並按$(item)$(k:key.use)$()就能在地上放置一個原木堆。手持原木對準原木堆按$(item)$(k:key.use)$()，或直接開啟原木堆介面就能放入更多原木。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:multiblock",
            "multiblock": {
                "pattern": [
                    [
                        "X"
                    ],
                    [
                        "0"
                    ]
                ],
                "mapping": {
                    "X": "tfc:log_pile"
                }
            },
            "name": "原木堆",
            "text": "原木堆需要下方有一個實心塊。它們很容易著火。",
            "enable_visualize": false
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "text": "The charcoal pit is formed by surrounding log piles with solid, non-flammable blocks. The amount of charcoal produced is proportional to the amount of logs contained inside the log piles. To start the burning process, light one of the log piles, and then cover it. If it worked, you should see $(thing)smoke$() particles rise up from the structure.$(br)You can make a charcoal pit any size and shape so long as its fully insulated.$(br)By default the charcoal pit will take $(t:15 minutes)18 in-game hours.$()"
        },
